{
  "id": "宁戚",
  "name": "宁戚",
  "pinyin": "",
  "aliases": [],
  "type": "person",
  "typeConfidence": "high",
  "description": "春秋卫国人，未遇时曾经商",
  "mentions": [
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "entryId": "chuci-01-11",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "春秋卫国人，未遇时曾经商"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "entryId": "chuci-01-11",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "鼓刀兮，\n\n遭周文而得举。\n\n宁戚之讴歌兮，\n\n齐桓闻以该辅。\n"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "entryId": "chuci-04-09",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "庖厨。\n\n吕望屠于朝歌兮,\n\n宁戚歌而饭牛。\n\n不逢汤武与桓缪兮"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 8,
      "entryId": "chuci-08-09",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "知乘兮,\n\n焉皇皇而更索？\n\n宁戚讴于车下兮,\n\n桓公闻而知之。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 11,
      "entryId": "chuci-11-03",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "聊生兮,\n\n遭周文而舒志。\n\n宁戚饭牛而商歌兮,\n\n桓公闻而弗置"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 12,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-12-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "一辞，可与曲说，未可与广应也。宁戚击牛角而歌，桓公举以大政；雍门"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 13,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-13-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "尧之举舜也，决之于目；桓公之取宁戚也，断之于耳而已矣。为是释术数"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 15,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-15-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "饭牛，伊尹之负鼎，太公之鼓刀，宁戚之商歌，其美有存焉者矣。众人见"
    }
  ],
  "firstSeen": {
    "bookId": "chuci",
    "chapterIndex": 1
  }
}
